\c 3
\s1 Rebuilding the altar
\rem /s1 The Altar Is Rebuilt; Worship Begins Again; Rebuilding the Altar; Worship Restored at Jerusalem; Restoration of altar and temple
\p
\v 1 In the¦218082 seventh¦218082 month¦218081, the¦218083 Israelis¦218084 from \add &their\add* \add various\add* cities¦218085, gathered¦218087 together \add ≈in unity\add* in Yerushalem¦218093.
\v 2 Then¦218096 Yotsadak's¦218100 son Yeshua¦218097 and¦218101 his brothers the¦218102 priests¦218102, and¦218103 Shealti'el's son Zerubavel¦218103 and¦218107 his brothers, and¦218108 they¦218108 built¦218108 the¦218111 altar¦218111 to¦218114 offer¦218114 up¦218114 burnt¦218116 offerings¦218116 to Yisrael's¦218113 god on¦218115 it¦218115 as is¦218117 written¦218117 in¦218118 the¦218118 law¦218118 of¦218118 Mosheh¦218119, the¦218120 man¦218120 of¦218120 God.\x + \xo 3:2: \xt Exo 27:1.\x*
\v 3 They¦218124 set the¦218125 altar¦218125 up¦218134 on¦218126 its¦218128 \add #foundation¦218128\add* because¦218129 they were¦218131 worried \add about trouble from\add* some of the¦218132 \add other\add* people¦218132 groups \add ≈in the¦218133 region\add*. Then¦218134 they¦218134 offered¦218134 burnt¦218138 offerings¦218138 to¦218139 Yahweh¦218139 on it \add as well as the regular\add* morning¦218141 and¦218142 evening¦218142 burnt offerings.\x + \xo 3:3: \xt Num 28:1-8.\x*
\v 4 Then¦218144 they¦218144 observed the¦218147 Celebration¦218147 in Shelters as \add ≈per the¦218148 written¦218149 instructions\add*\x + \xo 3:4: \xt Num 29:12-38.\x* with a¦218150 burnt¦218150 offering¦218150 each day as required.
\v 5 After¦218160 that \add was over\add*, they kept up the \add ≈regular¦218164\add* burnt¦218163 offerings¦218163, plus¦218165 those for¦218165 the new moons¦218165 and¦218166 other times¦218168 that Yahweh¦218169 required, as well as any free-will¦218173 offerings¦218173 to¦218174 Yahweh¦218174.\x + \xo 3:5: \xt Num 28:11–29:39.\x*
\v 6 ⇔\add ≈Even though the temple¦218184 foundation¦218187 rebuilding hadn't started yet\add*, the people started sacrificing burnt¦218182 offerings¦218182 to¦218183 Yahweh \add ≈from the beginning¦218180 of October\add*.
\s1 Rebuilding the temple
