\p
\v 1 \add ≈Now\add* the¦218390 enemies¦218390 of Yehudah¦218391 and¦218392 Benyamin¦218392 heard¦218389 that¦218393 the¦218395 \add ≈Israelis who'd come back from\add* exile¦218396 were¦218397 building¦218397 a¦218398 temple¦218398 for¦218399 Yisrael's god¦218400 Yahweh¦218399.
\v 2 \add ≈so¦218403\add* they¦218403 went to¦218404 Zerubavel¦218406 and¦218407 to¦218407 the \add other\add* \add ≈clan leaders\add* and¦218411 they¦218411 said¦218411 to¦218412 them¦218412, “Let¦218413 us¦218413 \add ≈help you with the building¦218413 work\add*, because¦218415 like¦218416 you¦218416, we¦218417 \add ≈worship\add* your¦218418 god¦218418 and¦218419 we've¦218422 been¦218423 sacrificing¦218423 to him since¦218424 the¦218424 days¦218424 of¦218424 the¦218427 Assyrian king¦218427 Esar¦218425-Haddon¦218426—the one who¦218429 \add ≈sent\add* us¦218430 here¦218431.”\x + \xo 4:2: \xt 2Ki 17:24-41.\x*
\p
\v 3 \add ≈But\add* Zerubavel¦218435, and¦218436 Yeshua¦218436, and¦218437 the¦218437 rest¦218437 of¦218437 the \add ≈Israelis¦218440 clan leaders\add* said¦218433 to¦218434 them, “It's¦218433 not¦218441 for¦218443 you¦218443 and¦218444 for¦218444 us¦218444 to¦218445 build¦218445 a¦218446 house¦218446 for¦218447 our¦218447 god, but we¦218449 ourselves together¦218450 will¦218451 build¦218451 for¦218452 Yisrael's god Yahweh¦218452, just¦218455 as¦218455 the¦218457 Persian King¦218457 Koresh¦218458 \add !(Cyrus)\add* has commanded¦218456 us¦218456.”
\p
\v 4 \add ≈Those local\add* people¦218464 had been¦218467 discouraging the¦218469 people¦218469 of¦218469 Yehudah¦218471 and¦218472 trying to¦218475 stop them¦218474 from building¦218475.
