\v 15 so that¦218678 he¦218679 can search¦218679 in¦218680 the \add ≈official records of the kingdom\add*. You'll¦218685 discover¦218685 and¦218688 learn¦218688 that that city¦218690 \add of Yerushalem\add* is¦218692 a¦218692 rebellious¦218693 city and¦218694 one that has caused harm to kings¦218695 and¦218696 provinces¦218696, and¦218697 \add ≈has harboured rebellion there for decades past\add*—\add ≈that's why\add* that¦218706 city¦218707 was¦218709 destroyed.
