\p
\v 3 At¦218929 that time¦218931, Tattenai¦218934, the¦218935 governor¦218935 of¦218935 \add ≈the¦218936 province¦218936 west of the¦218938 Euphrates\add*, and Shetar¦218939-Bozenai, and¦218941 their¦218941 companions¦218941 came¦218932 to¦218944 them¦218944 and \add ≈demanded¦218943\add*, “Who¦218945 \add ≈gave you¦218948 all permission to¦218952 rebuild¦218952 this¦218954 temple¦218950\add*?”
