\p
\v 1 \add ≈So¦219295\add* King¦219292 Dareyavesh¦219291 \add !(Darius¦219291)\add* \add ≈ordered¦219294 that a¦219294 search¦219295 be conducted\add* in¦219297 \add all\add* the¦219298 \add ≈archives\add* where¦219299 treasures¦219300 had been¦219301 deposited¦219301 there¦219302 in¦219303 Babylon¦219303,
