\v 3 “In¦219320 year¦219320 one¦219321 of Koresh¦219322 the¦219323 king¦219323, \add *he¦219324\add* made¦219326 a¦219327 decree¦219327 about the¦219328 house¦219328 of¦219328 God¦219330 in¦219331 Yerushalem¦219331:
