\v 5 Also¦219366, the¦219367 gold¦219372 and¦219373 silver¦219373 containers¦219367 from the¦219368 house¦219368 of¦219368 God¦219370 that¦219374 Nevukadnetstsar¦219375 had taken¦219376 out¦219376 from¦219377 the¦219379 Yerushalem¦219382 temple and¦219383 had brought¦219383 to¦219384 Babylon¦219384, must be returned to¦219387 their \add #places¦219391\add* in the¦219387 temple¦219387 in¦219390 Yerushalem¦219390. \add ≈So¦219392\add* you¦219392 must¦219392 put them¦219392 in¦219393 the house¦219393 of¦219393 God¦219394.’ ”
