\v 6 \add Therefore King Dareyavesh wrote:\add* “Now¦219397 to Governor¦219399 Tattenai¦219398 \add ≈in the¦219399 province west of¦219399 the Euphrates\add*, Shetar¦219403-Bozenai¦219404, and¦219405 their¦219405 companions¦219405, the¦219407 officials¦219407 who¦219408 in¦219409 that province¦219409:
