\v 7 Leave¦219417 alone the¦219418 work¦219418 on that house¦219419 of¦219419 God¦219421. Let¦219431 the¦219423 Jewish governor¦219423 and¦219425 elders¦219425 build¦219431 that \add ≈temple\add* in its¦219434 place¦219434.
