\v 9 Whatever¦219470 is needed¦219471 (\add ≈including¦219472 young¦219472\add* bulls¦219473, or rams¦219474, or lambs¦219475 for¦219477 burnt¦219477 offerings¦219477 to¦219479 the god¦219479 of the¦219480 heavens¦219480, wheat¦219481, salt¦219482, wine¦219484, or oil¦219485, according¦219486 to¦219486 the¦219486 command of¦219486 the¦219487 priests¦219487 in¦219490 Yerushalem¦219490), let it¦219491 be¦219491 given¦219492 to¦219493 them¦219493 day¦219494 by day¦219496 (that¦219497 is, without delay),
\v 10 so that¦219502 they¦219504 can be¦219504 offering¦219505 sweet-smelling sacrifices to¦219507 the god¦219507 of the¦219508 heavens¦219508 and¦219509 praying¦219509 for¦219510 the¦219510 life¦219510 of¦219510 the¦219511 king¦219511 and¦219512 his¦219512 sons¦219512.
\v 11 \add ≈Also¦219514 I\add* decree¦219516 that¦219517 any man¦219520 who¦219521 changes this¦219524 edict should have a¦219526 beam¦219526 pulled¦219525 from¦219527 his house, and¦219530 \add after it's sharpened and\add* \add ≈set into the ground\add*, then he¦219530 should¦219531 be¦219531 impaled¦219531 on¦219532 it¦219532. Then¦219533 his \add entire\add* house should¦219535 be¦219535 made¦219535 into a rubbish heap \add ≈because of what he did\add*.
\v 12 May the¦219540 god¦219540 who¦219541 has¦219542 established his¦219543 name¦219543 there¦219544 overthrow¦219545 any king¦219548 or person¦219549 who¦219550 \add ≈makes any attempt\add* to¦219554 change \add this decree or\add* to¦219555 destroy¦219555 that¦219560 house¦219556 of¦219556 God¦219558 in¦219561 Yerushalem¦219561. I¦219562, Dareyavesh¦219563, have \add ≈made¦219564\add* a¦219565 decree¦219565. Let¦219567 it¦219567 be¦219567 done¦219567 diligently¦219566.”
\s1 The temple dedication
