\v 13 Then¦219570 Tattenai¦219571, the¦219572 governor¦219572 of¦219572 \add ≈the¦219573 region¦219573 west of the¦219575 Euphrates\add*, Shetar¦219576-Bozenai¦219577, and¦219578 their¦219578 companions¦219578 \add ≈worked hard to¦219579 follow the instructions sent¦219582 by King¦219584 Dareyavesh¦219583\add* \add !(Darius)\add*.
