\v 11 King¦219935 Artahshasta \add !(Artaxerxes)\add* had given¦219934 a letter¦219932 for Ezra¦219937 the¦219938 priest¦219938 and scribe and \add ≈expert\add* in Yahweh's¦219944 commands¦219942 and¦219945 instructions¦219945 \add to take with him\add*, \add ≈saying\add*:
