\v 12 Artahshasta, the¦219952 king¦219952 of¦219952 kings¦219953, to¦219954 the¦219955 priest¦219955 Ezra¦219954, the¦219956 scribe¦219956 of¦219956 the¦219957 law¦219957 of¦219958 the¦219960 god¦219960 of¦219960 heavens¦219961: Peace.
\p Now¦219963,
\v 13 \add ≈I hereby\add* decree¦219967 that¦219968 anyone¦219971 in¦219972 my¦219972 kingdom¦219972 from¦219973 Yisrael¦219976 (including¦219977 priests¦219977 and¦219978 Levites¦219978) who¦219971 freely offers to¦219979 go¦219979 to¦219980 Yerushalem¦219980 with¦219981 you¦219981, may go¦219982.
\v 14 \add ≈You¦219994 are¦219994 sent¦219994 by\add* the¦219991 king¦219991 and¦219992 his seven¦219992 counsellors¦219993 to¦219995 \add ≈determine whether\add* \add the people of\add* Yehudah¦219998 and¦219999 Yerushalem¦219999 \add ≈are following\add* the¦220000 law¦220000 of¦220000 your¦220001 god¦220001 which¦220002 \add ≈you have a copy of¦220003\add*.
\v 15 \add ≡You are also\add* to¦220005 take¦220005 the gold¦220007 and silver¦220006 that¦220008 the¦220010 king¦220010 and¦220011 his¦220011 counsellors¦220011 have¦220012 freely¦220012 offered¦220012 to¦220013 the god¦220013 of¦220014 Yisrael¦220014 \add ≈who¦220015 lives\add* in¦220016 Jerusalem¦220016,
