\p
\v 17 \add ≈So then\add* you should diligently¦220041 \add ≈use those funds\add* to buy¦220042 bulls¦220045, rams¦220047, lambs¦220048, and¦220049 \add supplies for\add* their¦220049 grain¦220049 offerings¦220049 and¦220050 drink¦220050 offerings¦220050, and¦220051 you¦220051 should offer¦220051 them¦220052 on¦220053 the¦220055 altar¦220055 at the¦220057 your¦220058 god's¦220058 house¦220057 in¦220060 Yerushalem¦220060.
