\v 20 \add ≈Anything else that's\add* needed¦220095 for the¦220096 house¦220096 of¦220096 your¦220097 god¦220097 that¦220098 \add ≈you¦220101 need to¦220102 supply can be provided\add* from¦220104 the¦220108 king's¦220108 treasuries¦220107.
\p
\v 21 And¦220110 I¦220111, King¦220113 Artahshasta \add ≈make¦220114\add* a¦220115 decree¦220115 for all¦220116 the¦220117 treasurers¦220117 \add ≈in¦220119 the¦220119 province¦220119 west of\add* the¦220120 river¦220120: that¦220121 you all¦220122 diligently¦220134 help with everything that¦220124 the¦220127 priest¦220127 Ezra¦220126 (the¦220128 scribe¦220128 of¦220128 the¦220129 law¦220129 of¦220130 the¦220132 god¦220132 of¦220132 the¦220133 heavens¦220133) asks¦220125 from you¦220125 all—
\v 22 up¦220137 to¦220137 three tonnes of silver¦220139, five hundred¦220141 bushels of wheat¦220144, two thousand litres of wine¦220149 and¦220152 \add ≈the same amount\add* of \add olive\add* oil¦220155, and¦220157 \add ≈as much salt¦220157 as he needs\add*.
\v 23 Everything that¦220165 the¦220169 god¦220169 of¦220169 the¦220170 heavens¦220170 decreed¦220168 to be done should¦220171 be¦220171 done¦220171 exactly¦220172 \add ≈as he specified because¦220173 there's no good reason to make him angry¦220180 at\add* the¦220183 kingdom¦220183 of¦220183 the¦220184 king¦220184 and¦220185 his¦220185 sons¦220185?
\v 24 ⇔\add ≈Also¦220187, it should be¦220188 made¦220188 clear\add* that¦220189 there is no \add ≈authority\add* to \add ≈extract\add* \add #taxes¦220202\add* or tribute¦220201 from any priests¦220192 or Levites¦220193, singers¦220194 or the¦220195 gatekeepers¦220195, the¦220196 temple¦220196 servants¦220196 or the¦220197 servants¦220197 of¦220197 that house¦220198 of¦220198 God¦220199.
\p
