\v 27 Blessed¦220271 be Yahweh¦220272, the¦220273 god¦220273 of¦220273 our¦220274 fathers¦220274 who¦220275 put¦220276 it into¦220278 the¦220279 king's¦220279 heart¦220278 to¦220280 honour¦220280 Yahweh's¦220284 house¦220283 in¦220286 Yerushalem¦220286,
\v 28 and¦220288 showed me¦220288 his loyal¦220291 commitment in¦220292 \add ≈dealing with\add* the¦220293 king¦220293 and¦220294 his¦220294 counsellors¦220294, and¦220295 all¦220295 the¦220297 powerful¦220299 officials¦220297 of¦220297 the¦220298 king¦220298. And¦220300 as for me, Yahweh¦220304 my¦220305 god¦220305 \add ≈blessed me¦220306 with\add* \add initiative and\add* \add ≈the strength¦220301 to¦220302 carry it out as\add* I¦220307 gathered¦220307 some Israeli¦220308 \add ≈leaders¦220309\add* to¦220310 go¦220310 \add ≈to Yerushalem\add* with¦220311 me¦220311.
