\p
\v 21 Then¦220594 \add right\add* there¦220595 by the¦220599 river¦220599 Ahava¦220600, I proclaimed¦220594 a¦220596 fast¦220596 to¦220601 humble¦220601 ourselves¦220601 \add ≈in¦220602 front¦220602 of¦220602\add* our¦220603 god¦220603 to¦220604 \add ≈request¦220604 that he'd smooth the\add* way¦220606 \add ahead\add* for¦220608 us¦220608, and¦220609 for¦220609 our¦220609 children, and¦220610 for¦220610 all¦220610 our¦220612 property¦220612,
\v 22 because¦220614 I¦220615 was¦220615 ashamed¦220615 to¦220616 request¦220637 an army and horsemen¦220621 from¦220617 the¦220619 king¦220619 to¦220622 help¦220622 us¦220622 from¦220623 \add ≈possible enemies¦220623\add* on¦220624 the way¦220624. \add ≈Also, you see,\add* we¦220627 had¦220627 \add previously\add* told¦220627 the¦220628 king¦220628, “Our¦220632 god¦220632 \add ≈does\add* good¦220638 to all¦220635 those¦220637 who¦220637 \add ≈honour\add* him¦220637, but¦220639 his¦220639 might and¦220640 his \add ≈anger¦220640\add* are¦220641 against¦220641 all¦220642 those¦220644 who¦220644 abandon¦220644 him¦220644.”
\v 23 \add ≈So¦220646\add* we¦220646 fasted¦220646 and¦220647 sought¦220647 \add wisdom\add* from¦220648 our¦220648 god¦220648 concerning this¦220651, and¦220652 he¦220652 \add ≈listened to¦220653 our requests\add*.
