\v 30 \add ≈So¦220756\add* the¦220757 priests¦220757 and¦220758 the¦220758 Levites¦220758 \add ≈accepted\add* the¦220759 \add ≈receipt\add* of¦220759 the¦220761 gold¦220761 and silver¦220760, and¦220762 the¦220762 containers¦220762, to¦220763 take¦220763 them to¦220764 Yerushalem¦220764—to¦220765 the¦220765 house¦220765 of¦220765 our¦220766 god¦220766.
\s1 The return to Yerushalem
